# S.S. Botany Bay: its {T} ability's exile is linked to it (CR 607.2a) but is NOT "until it leaves the battlefield" -
# destroying the artifact leaves the exiled cards in exile, because CR 610.3 does not apply to an exile with no stated
# duration (g.exile_with(..., until_leaves = false)); and the combat-damage trigger resolving with nothing exiled with
# it returns nothing and does not fail.

